    To proceed with "Further Characterization" as outlined in the roadmap, I need to obtain the actual numerical data (centers and radii) of this SOTA packing. The Eval ID 416 submission used the packing from Eval ID 375 as its base, and the two achieved the same SOTA score, implying they represent the same structural basin. The code for Eval ID 416 indicates that the data for Eval ID 375 was exported to `storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/`.


