parts:
- text: "I have saved the `jaccard_calculator.py` script. Now, I will submit a new utility evaluation to calculate the Jaccard similarities between Scientia I's SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375) and other SOTA packings using the contact data I generated. This will quantitatively confirm the structural distinctness.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility: Jaccard Similarity Calculation for Comparative Structural Analysis\"\ntags: \"utility, jaccard similarity, contact graph, structural distinctness, N=26, quantitative analysis\"\nabstract: \"This utility calculates the Jaccard similarity indices for both active boundary and pair contact sets between Scientia I's absolute SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375) and other prominent N=26 SOTA packings (Scientia I (259), Noesis I (243), and Prometheus I (298)). It utilizes previously generated contact data to provide quantitative validation of structural distinctness as a follow-up to the lineage roadmap.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy\
    \ as np\n  import os\n  import sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis')\n  from jaccard_calculator import _read_contact_file, jaccard_similarity\n\n  # Paths to contact data for Scientia I's SOTA (Eval ID 416/375)\n  SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_OUT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_416'\n  SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_BOUNDARY_FILE = os.path.join(SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_OUT_DIR, 'active_boundary_contacts.txt')\n  SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_PAIR_FILE = os.path.join(SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_OUT_DIR, 'active_pair_contacts.txt')\n\n  # Paths to contact data for other SOTAs (generated by Eval ID 459)\n  SCIENTIA_259_OUT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_scientia_259'\n  SCIENTIA_259_BOUNDARY_FILE = os.path.join(SCIENTIA_259_OUT_DIR, 'scientia_259_boundary_contacts.txt')\n  SCIENTIA_259_PAIR_FILE = os.path.join(SCIENTIA_259_OUT_DIR, 'scientia_259_pair_contacts.txt')\n\n  NOESIS_243_OUT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_noesis_243'\n\
    \  NOESIS_243_BOUNDARY_FILE = os.path.join(NOESIS_243_OUT_DIR, 'noesis_243_boundary_contacts.txt')\n  NOESIS_243_PAIR_FILE = os.path.join(NOESIS_243_OUT_DIR, 'noesis_243_pair_contacts.txt')\n\n  PROMETHEUS_298_OUT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_prometheus_298'\n  PROMETHEUS_298_BOUNDARY_FILE = os.path.join(PROMETHEUS_298_OUT_DIR, 'prometheus_298_boundary_contacts.txt')\n  PROMETHEUS_298_PAIR_FILE = os.path.join(PROMETHEUS_298_OUT_DIR, 'prometheus_298_pair_contacts.txt')\n\n  # Output directory for Jaccard results\n  JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/jaccard_results_416_comparison'\n\n  # Path to Scientia I's Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375/416) for the default return\n  D_SCIENTIA_NUDGED_375_DATA_EXPORTED = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data'\n  N_CIRCLES = 26 # Fixed for this task\n\n\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n      try:\n   \
    \       centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES)\n\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Calculates and stores Jaccard similarities between SOTA contact graphs.\n      \"\"\"\n      # Ensure Jaccard results directory exists\n      os.makedirs(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      results_filepath = os.path.join(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, 'jaccard_comparison_summary.txt')\n\n      summary_lines = [\"Jaccard Similarity Comparison Results:\\n\"]\n\n      # Load contact data for Scientia I's SOTA (Eval ID 416/375)\n      s_416_boundary = _read_contact_file(SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_BOUNDARY_FILE)\n      s_416_pair = _read_contact_file(SCIENTIA_SOTA_416_PAIR_FILE)\n      print(f\"Loaded Eval ID 416/375 boundary contacts: {len(s_416_boundary)},\
    \ pair contacts: {len(s_416_pair)}\")\n\n      comparisons = [\n          (\"Scientia_259\", SCIENTIA_259_BOUNDARY_FILE, SCIENTIA_259_PAIR_FILE),\n          (\"Noesis_243\", NOESIS_243_BOUNDARY_FILE, NOESIS_243_PAIR_FILE),\n          (\"Prometheus_298\", PROMETHEUS_298_BOUNDARY_FILE, PROMETHEUS_298_PAIR_FILE),\n      ]\n\n      for name, boundary_file, pair_file in comparisons:\n          print(f\"\\n--- Comparing with {name} ---\")\n          other_boundary = _read_contact_file(boundary_file)\n          other_pair = _read_contact_file(pair_file)\n          print(f\"Loaded {name} boundary contacts: {len(other_boundary)}, pair contacts: {len(other_pair)}\")\n\n          j_boundary = jaccard_similarity(s_416_boundary, other_boundary)\n          j_pair = jaccard_similarity(s_416_pair, other_pair)\n\n          print(f\"Jaccard Boundary Similarity (416/375 vs {name}): {j_boundary:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"Jaccard Pair Similarity (416/375 vs {name}): {j_pair:.4f}\")\n\n          summary_lines.append(f\"\
    Comparison: Scientia_SOTA_416_375 vs {name}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_boundary:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Write summary to a file\n      with open(results_filepath, 'w') as f:\n          f.writelines(summary_lines)\n      print(f\"\\nJaccard similarity analysis complete. Results saved to {results_filepath}\")\n\n      # Return a valid 26-circle packing for evaluation\n      default_centers, default_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(\n          os.path.join(D_SCIENTIA_NUDGED_375_DATA_EXPORTED, 'centers.txt'),\n          os.path.join(D_SCIENTIA_NUDGED_375_DATA_EXPORTED, 'radii.txt')\n      )\n      return default_centers, default_radii\n```"
thinking_content: '**Validating Structural Distinctness Through Jaccard Similarity**


