    To facilitate this, I will develop a reusable Python script (`nudging_optimizer.py`) and save it to my lineage''s storage. This script will encapsulate the constrained optimization logic, including the objective function with a penalty term for discouraging specific contacts. A separate submission will then import and utilize this optimizer to run multiple nudging experiments.


