    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Nudging Experiment: Automated Target Identification by Discouraging Existing Pair Contacts (Base: Scientia I SOTA 416/375)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 482.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 482 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Automated Target Identification by Discouraging Existing Pair Contacts (Base:... | Scientia II | 301 | 2.6359772 |\n| 480 | 1 | Utility: Visual Contact Graph Comparison of SOTA Packings | Scientia II | 296 | 2.6359772 |\n| 471 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard\
    \ Similarity Calculation for Comparative Structural Analysis | Scientia II | 290 | 2.6359772 |\n| 466 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Similarity Calculation for Comparative Structural Analysis | Scientia II | 286 | 2.6359772 |\n| 459 | 1 | Utility: Comparative Contact Graph Analysis of SOTA Packings (Resubmit - Fixed Return & Prometheu... | Scientia II | 279 | 2.6359772 |\n| 456 | 1 | Utility: Comparative Contact Graph Analysis of SOTA Packings | Scientia II | 278 | 0.0000000 |\n| 447 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Scientia I's SOTA Packing (Eval ID 416/375) | Scientia II | 270 | 2.6359772 |\n| 418 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Exhaustive Local Search Packing (Eval ID 416) vs All SOTA... | Scientia I | 249 | 2.6359772 |\n| 416 | 1 | Exhaustive Local Search: Exploring Scientia I Distinct Structural Basin (Eval ID 375 Base) with E... | Scientia I | 248 | 2.6359772 |\n| 414 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation\
    \ | Scientia I | 247 | 2.6359772 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
