- text: "I have saved the `exhaustive_local_search.py` script. I also received a mail from Noesis II. I need to address the research inactivity notice immediately.\n\nMy primary focus is the hybrid optimization strategy. I will now submit an experiment that applies the \"Exhaustive Seeding\" local search (from `exhaustive_local_search.py`) to my newly discovered SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528). This will act as the \"deep local search\" component of the hybrid strategy. The purpose is to see if an even deeper optimum can be found within this new structural basin.\n\nI will also quickly address Noesis II's mail about KKT multipliers, but I will do so after submitting this experiment to ensure I break the inactivity streak. I will need to check if I have any relevant KKT multiplier data to share, which I currently do not, as my focus has been on nudging and contact graphs.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Hybrid Optimization: Exhaustive Local Search on New SOTA Packing (from\
    \ Eval ID 528)\"\ntags: \"hybrid optimization, exhaustive search, local search, new SOTA, N=26, refinement\"\nabstract: \"This experiment implements the 'Exhaustive Seeding' local search methodology, adapted from Prometheus I's work, on the newly discovered SOTA packing (Σr = 2.635983, from Eval ID 528). The objective is to identify if an even deeper optimum can be found within this novel structural basin, as part of a hybrid optimization strategy that combines structural traversal (nudging) with deep local refinement. The results will establish the maximum potential of this new structural class.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import os\n  import sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/optimization')\n  from exhaustive_local_search import run_exhaustive_local_search, N\n\n  # Paths to the new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528)\n  NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\n\
    \  NEW_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n  # Output directory for results of this exhaustive local search\n  RESULTS_ROOT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exhaustive_search_new_sota'\n\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Runs exhaustive local search on the new SOTA packing.\n      \"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      \n      # Load the new SOTA packing as the base for exhaustive search\n\
    \      initial_centers, initial_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, NEW_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n      if initial_centers is None or initial_radii is None:\n          print(\"Failed to load new SOTA packing data. Cannot run exhaustive search.\")\n          # Return a known valid packing if base fails\n          return load_packing_data_for_return('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt',\n                                            'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt')\n\n      print(f\"Loaded new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528) as base for exhaustive local search.\")\n      print(f\"Base sum of radii: {np.sum(initial_radii):.6f}\")\n      \n      # Run the exhaustive local search\n      optimized_centers, optimized_radii, final_score, success = run_exhaustive_local_search(\n          initial_centers.copy(), initial_radii.copy()\n      )\n\n      if success:\n          print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local Search successful. Final Score\
    \ (Sum of Radii): {final_score:.6f}\")\n          # Save results\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), optimized_centers)\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), optimized_radii)\n          with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n              f.write(str(final_score))\n          print(f\"Results saved to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n      else:\n          print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local Search failed or did not find an improved packing.\")\n          # Store the initial packing if no improvement found\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), initial_centers)\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), initial_radii)\n          with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n              f.write(str(np.sum(initial_radii)))\n          print(f\"Original packing saved as fallback to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n\n      # Return the final (or initial\
    \ if no improvement) packing to satisfy the evaluator\n      return optimized_centers if success else initial_centers, optimized_radii if success else initial_radii\n```"
