tick: 357
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have successfully analyzed the contact graph for the nudged `encourage_1_2` packing (Eval ID 566). It has 16 boundary contacts and 4 pair contacts. This is again a different structure than my current SOTA (6 pair contacts) and the exhaustive search result (3 pair contacts), all maintaining the SOTA score. This further reinforces the ability of nudging to generate diverse SOTA-level structural variants.\n\nMy next step is to quantify this structural change using aligned Jaccard similarity. I will compare the contact graph of the `nudged_encourage_1_2` packing against:\n1.  My current SOTA packing (`new_sota_encourage_2_3` from Eval ID 528).\n2.  The original Scientia I SOTA (`416/375`).\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2) vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA\"\ntags: \"utility, jaccard similarity, structural distinctness, nudging, N=26, comparative\"\nabstract: \"This utility calculates the ALIGNED Jaccard\
    \ similarity indices for boundary and pair contact sets. It compares the nudged packing 'encourage_1_2' (from Eval ID 565) against the new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528) and the original Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 416/375). This aims to quantitatively assess structural changes induced by encouraging a new near-contact pair, further validating the automated target identification strategy.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import os\n  import sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis')\n  from jaccard_calculator import _read_contact_file, jaccard_similarity\n\n  # GLOBAL CONSTANTS (for load_packing_data_for_return)\n  N_CIRCLES = 26 # Fixed for this task\n\n  # Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n       \
    \   return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES)\n\n  # Paths to the nudged packing (Encourage 1-2 from Eval ID 565)\n  NUDGED_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v3/encourage_1_2'\n  NUDGED_CENTERS = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  NUDGED_RADII = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  NUDGED_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_1_2/nudged_encourage_1_2_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  NUDGED_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_1_2/nudged_encourage_1_2_pair_contacts.txt'\n  NUDGED_NAME = 'Nudged_Encourage_1_2'\n\n  # Paths to the NEW SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528)\n  NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\n  NEW_SOTA_CENTERS = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR,\
    \ 'centers.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_RADII = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_new_sota_encourage_2_3/new_sota_encourage_2_3_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  NEW_SOTA_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_new_sota_encourage_2_3/new_sota_encourage_2_3_pair_contacts.txt'\n  NEW_SOTA_NAME = 'New_SOTA_Encourage_2_3'\n\n  # Paths to the BASE SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375)\n  BASE_SOTA_CENTERS = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_RADII = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_416/active_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_416/active_pair_contacts.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_NAME = 'Base_SOTA_416_375'\n\n  # Output directory for Jaccard results\n  JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/jaccard_results_encourage_1_2_comparison'\n\n  def _load_packing_data(centers_path,\
    \ radii_path, boundary_file, pair_file, packing_name):\n      \"\"\"Helper to load all relevant packing data.\"\"\"\n      centers, radii, boundary_contacts, pair_contacts = None, None, set(), set()\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          boundary_contacts = _read_contact_file(boundary_file)\n          pair_contacts = _read_contact_file(pair_file)\n          print(f\"Loaded all data for {packing_name}.\")\n          return centers, radii, boundary_contacts, pair_contacts\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading {packing_name} data: {e}. Cannot perform full comparison.\")\n          return None, None, set(), set()\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Calculates and stores aligned Jaccard similarities for the nudged packing comparison.\n      \"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      results_filepath = os.path.join(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, 'jaccard_nudged_encourage_1_2_summary.txt')\n\
    \n      summary_lines = [\"Aligned Jaccard Similarity: Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2) vs. Other SOTAs\\n\"]\n\n      # Load data for the nudged packing\n      nudged_centers, nudged_radii, nudged_boundary, nudged_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          NUDGED_CENTERS, NUDGED_RADII, NUDGED_BOUNDARY_FILE, NUDGED_PAIR_FILE, NUDGED_NAME\n      )\n      if nudged_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Critical error: Failed to load {NUDGED_NAME} data. Cannot proceed.\")\n          return load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_RADII)\n      \n      print(f\"{NUDGED_NAME} boundary contacts: {len(nudged_boundary)}, pair contacts: {len(nudged_pair)}\")\n\n      # Load data for the New SOTA packing\n      new_sota_centers, new_sota_radii, new_sota_boundary, new_sota_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          NEW_SOTA_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_RADII, NEW_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE, NEW_SOTA_PAIR_FILE, NEW_SOTA_NAME\n      )\n      if new_sota_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load\
    \ {NEW_SOTA_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          new_sota_centers, new_sota_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n      # Load data for the Base SOTA packing\n      base_sota_centers, base_sota_radii, base_sota_boundary, base_sota_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          BASE_SOTA_CENTERS, BASE_SOTA_RADII, BASE_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE, BASE_SOTA_PAIR_FILE, BASE_SOTA_NAME\n      )\n      if base_sota_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load {BASE_SOTA_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          base_sota_centers, base_sota_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n      print(\"\\n--- Calculating Aligned Jaccard Similarities ---\")\n\n      # Comparison 1: Nudged vs New SOTA\n      if new_sota_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary, new_sota_boundary, nudged_centers, new_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota\
    \ = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair, new_sota_pair, nudged_centers, new_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {NEW_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {NEW_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Comparison 2: Nudged vs Base SOTA\n      if base_sota_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary, base_sota_boundary, nudged_centers, base_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair, base_sota_pair, nudged_centers, base_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison:\
    \ {NUDGED_NAME} vs {BASE_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {BASE_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Write summary to a file\n      with open(results_filepath, 'w') as f:\n          f.writelines(summary_lines)\n      print(f\"\\nAligned Jaccard similarity analysis complete. Results saved to {results_filepath}\")\n\n      # Return the current SOTA packing for evaluation\n      return load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_RADII)\n```"
