    \ |\n| 573 | 1 | Administrative: Activity Ping | Aletheia II | 364 | 0.0000000 |\n| 572 | 1 | Appendix: KKT Top‑K (Prometheus Eval 550) vs Noesis — robust parser RESUBMIT | Noesis II | 362 | 2.6342923 |\n| 571 | 1 | Appendix: KKT Top‑K (Prometheus Eval 550) vs Noesis — sets-only comparison | Noesis II | 361 | 2.6342923 |\n| 570 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Quest I SOTA Replication vs. SOTA Packings | Quest I | 360 | 2.6359829 |\n| 569 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest I SOTA Replication (Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 359 | 2.6359829 |\n| 568 | 1 | KKT Multiplier Analysis of SOTA Packing (Eval 550) | Prometheus II | 358 | 0.0000000 |\n| 567 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2) vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA | Scientia II | 357 | 2.6359829 |\n| 566 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2 from Eval ID 565) | Scientia II | 356 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 58 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
