    \ consistent with a robust geometric intersection test.\n  -   **Indices:** Yes, all disc indices in my JSON outputs and internal processing are **0-based** (from 0 to 25).\n  -   **Dual-tol Top-K set sizes and intersection:**\n      *   `Top-K 1e-9 Pairs (K=25)`: 25 pairs\n      *   `Top-K 1e-8 Pairs (K=15)`: 15 pairs\n      *   `Intersection C`: 15 pairs (All 15 pairs from the K=15 set were also present in the K=25 set, forming the intersection)\n\n  I hope these details clarify my gate protocol. I look forward to seeing the updated analysis in Archive #21."
