tick: 420
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am in the Research Counter. My primary next step is to apply \"Exhaustive Seeding\" local search (from Prometheus I, Archive #19) to my newly discovered SOTA *structural class* (`encourage_3_9` from Eval ID 641). This could potentially lead to breaking the current SOTA score and establishing a new global optimum.\n\nI will submit an experiment using my `exhaustive_local_search.py` script, with the `encourage_3_9` packing as its base.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Hybrid Optimization: Exhaustive Local Search on New SOTA Structural Class (from Eval ID 641)\"\ntags: \"hybrid optimization, exhaustive search, new SOTA structural class, N=26, refinement\"\nabstract: \"This experiment applies the 'Exhaustive Seeding' local search methodology (adapted from Prometheus I) to Scientia II's newly discovered SOTA structural class (Σr = 2.635983, from Eval ID 641). This unique packing has an unprecedented 0.0000 Pair Jaccard similarity against other SOTA variants. The objective\
    \ is to find an even deeper optimum within this novel structural basin, potentially establishing a new global SOTA and fully realizing the potential of this new structural class through a hybrid optimization approach.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import os\n  import sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/optimization')\n  from exhaustive_local_search import run_exhaustive_local_search, N\n\n  # Paths to the new SOTA structural class packing (from Eval ID 641)\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_3_9'\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n  # Output directory for results of this exhaustive local search\n  RESULTS_ROOT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exhaustive_search_new_sota_structural_class'\n\
    \n  # Path to the current highest SOTA packing for the default return\n  CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\n  CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Runs exhaustive local search on the new SOTA structural class packing.\n      \"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      \n\
    \      # Load the new SOTA structural class packing as the base for exhaustive search\n      initial_centers, initial_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(\n          NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS_PATH, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII_PATH\n      )\n      if initial_centers is None or initial_radii is None:\n          print(\"Failed to load new SOTA structural class packing data. Cannot run exhaustive search.\")\n          # Return a known valid packing if base fails\n          return load_packing_data_for_return(CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n\n      print(f\"Loaded new SOTA structural class packing (from Eval ID 641) as base for exhaustive local search.\")\n      print(f\"Base sum of radii: {np.sum(initial_radii):.6f}\")\n      \n      # Run the exhaustive local search\n      optimized_centers, optimized_radii, final_score, success = run_exhaustive_local_search(\n          initial_centers.copy(), initial_radii.copy()\n      )\n\n      if success:\n       \
    \   print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local Search successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): {final_score:.6f}\")\n          # Save results\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), optimized_centers)\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), optimized_radii)\n          with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n              f.write(str(final_score))\n          print(f\"Results saved to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n      else:\n          print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local Search failed or did not find an improved packing.\")\n          # Store the initial packing if no improvement found\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), initial_centers)\n          np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), initial_radii)\n          with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n              f.write(str(np.sum(initial_radii)))\n          print(f\"Original packing saved as fallback\
    \ to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n\n      # Return the final (or initial if no improvement) packing to satisfy the evaluator\n      return optimized_centers if success else initial_centers, optimized_radii if success else initial_radii\n```"
