parts:
- text: "I have successfully performed the contact graph analysis for the `encourage_8_14` nudged packing (Eval ID 675). It has 16 boundary contacts and 3 pair contacts. This is another SOTA-level packing with a unique structural signature.\n\nMy next step is to quantify this structural change using aligned Jaccard similarity. I will compare the contact graph of the `nudged_encourage_8_14` packing against:\n1.  My current SOTA structural class (`encourage_3_9` from Eval ID 641), which has 16 boundary and 2 pair contacts.\n2.  My previous SOTA (`new_sota_encourage_2_3` from Eval ID 528), which has 16 boundary and 6 pair contacts.\n3.  The original Scientia I SOTA (`416/375`), which had 16 boundary and 7 pair contacts.\n4.  The result of the exhaustive search on my SOTA (`exhaustive_search_new_sota` from Eval ID 554), which had 16 boundary and 3 pair contacts (making it a direct comparison for this new packing's sparsity).\n\nThis will provide a comprehensive understanding of how `encourage_8_14`\
    \ relates to the other SOTA-level packings I have discovered. I also need to be mindful of my token budget.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-14) vs. Key SOTA Variants\"\ntags: \"utility, jaccard similarity, structural distinctness, nudging, N=26, comparative\"\nabstract: \"This utility calculates the ALIGNED Jaccard similarity indices for boundary and pair contact sets. It compares the nudged packing 'encourage_8_14' (from Eval ID 673, with 3 pair contacts) against key SOTA variants: the new SOTA structural class (Eval ID 641, 2 pair contacts), the previous SOTA (Eval ID 528, 6 pair contacts), the original Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 416/375, 7 pair contacts), and the result of the exhaustive search on the new SOTA (Eval ID 554, 3 pair contacts). This aims to quantitatively assess its structural novelty and relationship within the SOTA landscape.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import os\n  import\
    \ sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis')\n  from jaccard_calculator import _read_contact_file, jaccard_similarity\n\n  # GLOBAL CONSTANTS (for load_packing_data_for_return)\n  N_CIRCLES = 26 # Fixed for this task\n\n  # Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES)\n\n  # Paths to the nudged packing (Encourage 8-14 from Eval ID 673)\n  NUDGED_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v7/encourage_8_14'\n  NUDGED_CENTERS = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n\
    \  NUDGED_RADII = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  NUDGED_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_8_14/nudged_encourage_8_14_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  NUDGED_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_8_14/nudged_encourage_8_14_pair_contacts.txt'\n  NUDGED_NAME = 'Nudged_Encourage_8_14'\n\n  # Paths to the New SOTA Structural Class (Encourage 3-9 from Eval ID 641)\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v6/encourage_3_9'\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_3_9/nudged_encourage_3_9_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_3_9/nudged_encourage_3_9_pair_contacts.txt'\n\
    \  NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_NAME = 'New_SOTA_Structural_Class_3_9'\n\n  # Paths to the Previous SOTA packing (Encourage 2-3 from Eval ID 528)\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_CENTERS = os.path.join(PREVIOUS_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_RADII = os.path.join(PREVIOUS_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_new_sota_encourage_2_3/new_sota_encourage_2_3_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_new_sota_encourage_2_3/new_sota_encourage_2_3_pair_contacts.txt'\n  PREVIOUS_SOTA_NAME = 'Previous_SOTA_Encourage_2_3'\n\n  # Paths to the BASE SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375)\n  BASE_SOTA_CENTERS = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_RADII = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_416/active_boundary_contacts.txt'\n\
    \  BASE_SOTA_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_416/active_pair_contacts.txt'\n  BASE_SOTA_NAME = 'Base_SOTA_416_375'\n\n  # Paths to the Exhaustive Search Result (Eval ID 554)\n  EXHAUSTIVE_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exhaustive_search_new_sota'\n  EXHAUSTIVE_CENTERS = os.path.join(EXHAUSTIVE_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  EXHAUSTIVE_RADII = os.path.join(EXHAUSTIVE_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n  EXHAUSTIVE_BOUNDARY_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_exhaustive_search_new_sota/exhaustive_search_new_sota_boundary_contacts.txt'\n  EXHAUSTIVE_PAIR_FILE = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_exhaustive_search_new_sota/exhaustive_search_new_sota_pair_contacts.txt'\n  EXHAUSTIVE_NAME = 'Exhaustive_Search_Result'\n\n\n  # Output directory for Jaccard results\n  JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/jaccard_results_encourage_8_14_comparison'\n\n  def _load_packing_data(centers_path, radii_path, boundary_file, pair_file, packing_name):\n      \"\"\"Helper\
    \ to load all relevant packing data.\"\"\"\n      centers, radii, boundary_contacts, pair_contacts = None, None, set(), set()\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          boundary_contacts = _read_contact_file(boundary_file)\n          pair_contacts = _read_contact_file(pair_file)\n          print(f\"Loaded all data for {packing_name}.\")\n          return centers, radii, boundary_contacts, pair_contacts\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading {packing_name} data: {e}. Cannot perform full comparison.\")\n          return None, None, set(), set()\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Calculates and stores aligned Jaccard similarities for the nudged packing comparison.\n      \"\"\"\n      os.makedirs(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      results_filepath = os.path.join(JACCARD_RESULTS_DIR, 'jaccard_nudged_encourage_8_14_summary.txt')\n\n      summary_lines = [\"Aligned\
    \ Jaccard Similarity: Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-14) vs. Key SOTA Variants\\n\"]\n\n      # Load data for the nudged packing (Encourage 8-14)\n      nudged_centers, nudged_radii, nudged_boundary, nudged_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          NUDGED_CENTERS, NUDGED_RADII, NUDGED_BOUNDARY_FILE, NUDGED_PAIR_FILE, NUDGED_NAME\n      )\n      if nudged_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Critical error: Failed to load {NUDGED_NAME} data. Cannot proceed.\")\n          return load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII)\n      \n      print(f\"{NUDGED_NAME} boundary contacts: {len(nudged_boundary)}, pair contacts: {len(nudged_pair)}\")\n\n      # Load data for the New SOTA Structural Class (Encourage 3-9)\n      new_sota_sc_centers, new_sota_sc_radii, new_sota_sc_boundary, new_sota_sc_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_BOUNDARY_FILE, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_PAIR_FILE,\
    \ NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_NAME\n      )\n      if new_sota_sc_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load {NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          new_sota_sc_centers, new_sota_sc_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n      # Load data for the Previous SOTA packing (Encourage 2-3)\n      prev_sota_centers, prev_sota_radii, prev_sota_boundary, prev_sota_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          PREVIOUS_SOTA_CENTERS, PREVIOUS_SOTA_RADII, PREVIOUS_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE, PREVIOUS_SOTA_PAIR_FILE, PREVIOUS_SOTA_NAME\n      )\n      if prev_sota_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load {PREVIOUS_SOTA_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          prev_sota_centers, prev_sota_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n      # Load data for the Base SOTA packing (416/375)\n      base_sota_centers, base_sota_radii, base_sota_boundary, base_sota_pair\
    \ = _load_packing_data(\n          BASE_SOTA_CENTERS, BASE_SOTA_RADII, BASE_SOTA_BOUNDARY_FILE, BASE_SOTA_PAIR_FILE, BASE_SOTA_NAME\n      )\n      if base_sota_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load {BASE_SOTA_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          base_sota_centers, base_sota_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n      # Load data for the Exhaustive Search Result (554)\n      exh_centers, exh_radii, exh_boundary, exh_pair = _load_packing_data(\n          EXHAUSTIVE_CENTERS, EXHAUSTIVE_RADII, EXHAUSTIVE_BOUNDARY_FILE, EXHAUSTIVE_PAIR_FILE, EXHAUSTIVE_NAME\n      )\n      if exh_centers is None:\n          print(f\"Warning: Failed to load {EXHAUSTIVE_NAME} data. Skipping comparison.\")\n          exh_centers, exh_radii = np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N_CIRCLES), np.array([1e-3] * N_CIRCLES) # Fallback\n\n\n      print(\"\\n--- Calculating Aligned Jaccard Similarities ---\")\n\n      # Comparison 1: Nudged_Encourage_8_14\
    \ vs New_SOTA_Structural_Class_3_9\n      if new_sota_sc_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary, new_sota_sc_boundary, nudged_centers, new_sota_sc_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair, new_sota_sc_pair, nudged_centers, new_sota_sc_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_new_sota_sc:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Comparison 2: Nudged_Encourage_8_14 vs Previous_SOTA_Encourage_2_3\n\
    \      if prev_sota_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_prev_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary, prev_sota_boundary, nudged_centers, prev_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_prev_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair, prev_sota_pair, nudged_centers, prev_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {PREVIOUS_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_prev_sota:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_prev_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {PREVIOUS_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_prev_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_prev_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Comparison 3: Nudged_Encourage_8_14 vs Base_SOTA_416_375\n      if base_sota_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary,\
    \ base_sota_boundary, nudged_centers, base_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair, base_sota_pair, nudged_centers, base_sota_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {BASE_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {BASE_SOTA_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_base_sota:.4f}\\n\")\n\n      # Comparison 4: Nudged_Encourage_8_14 vs Exhaustive_Search_Result\n      if exh_centers is not None:\n          j_bound_nudged_vs_exh = jaccard_similarity(nudged_boundary, exh_boundary, nudged_centers, exh_centers, aligned=True)\n          j_pair_nudged_vs_exh = jaccard_similarity(nudged_pair,\
    \ exh_pair, nudged_centers, exh_centers, aligned=True)\n          print(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {EXHAUSTIVE_NAME} (Aligned)\")\n          print(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_exh:.4f}\")\n          print(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_exh:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"Comparison: {NUDGED_NAME} vs {EXHAUSTIVE_NAME} (Aligned)\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Boundary Jaccard: {j_bound_nudged_vs_exh:.4f}\\n\")\n          summary_lines.append(f\"  Pair Jaccard: {j_pair_nudged_vs_exh:.4f}\\n\")\n\n\n      # Write summary to a file\n      with open(results_filepath, 'w') as f:\n          f.writelines(summary_lines)\n      print(f\"\\nAligned Jaccard similarity analysis complete. Results saved to {results_filepath}\")\n\n      # Return the current SOTA packing for evaluation\n      return load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_CENTERS, NEW_SOTA_STRUCTURAL_CLASS_RADII)\n```"
