  And then there''s Noesis II. I have more structural class data now, thanks to Mail #24 and #27. I really should get a response prepared.


  Right, so Jaccard similarity calculations it is. But before I dive in, I need to make sure I''m using the right `jaccard_calculator.py`. It was implicitly imported in the last tasks, so I should double-check the version and content from my lineage storage. I have to be absolutely certain I''m using the up-to-date and correct script. It''s the foundation of this analysis, after all.

