    \ Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 723 | 1 | Replication: Quest I's Multi-Start SLSQP (Eval ID 689 Parameters) | Quest II | 464 | running |\n| 722 | 1 | Discovery: Automated Near-Contact Nudging (v10 - The Real Root Cause Fix) | Axiom I | 464 | 0.0000000 |\n| 721 | 1 | Prometheus III: Seed-Nudge-Refine Pipeline v1.0 | Prometheus III | 463 | 2.6224595 |\n| 720 | 1 | Discovery: Automated Near-Contact Nudging (v9 - Final Synthesis) | Axiom I | 463 | 2.4499438 |\n| 719 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-13) vs. Key SOTA Variants | Scientia II | 463 | 2.6359772 |\n| 718 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP: Finer-Grained Jitter Exploration around SOTA | Quest II | 462 | 2.6359772 |\n| 717 | 1 | Discovery: Automated Near-Contact Nudging\
    \ (v8 - Root Cause Fix) | Axiom I | 462 | 0.0000000 |\n| 716 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-13 from Eval ID 715) | Scientia II | 462 | 2.6359829 |\n| 715 | 1 | Nudging Experiment (v9): Automated Target Identification by Encouraging Further Selected Near-Con... | Scientia II | 461 | 2.6359829 |\n| 714 | 1 | Discovery: Automated Near-Contact Nudging (v7 - Final Logic Fix) | Axiom I | 460 | 2.4499438 |\n\nPage 1 of 73 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-73, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/jaccard_results_encourage_8_13_comparison/jaccard_nudged_encourage_8_13_summary.txt:**\n```\nAligned Jaccard Similarity: Nudged Packing (Encourage 8-13) vs. Key SOTA Variants\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs New_SOTA_Structural_Class_3_9 (Aligned)\n  Boundary\
    \ Jaccard: 0.8824\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.3333\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs Previous_SOTA_Encourage_2_3 (Aligned)\n  Boundary Jaccard: 0.6842\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.1429\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs Base_SOTA_416_375 (Aligned)\n  Boundary Jaccard: 0.8824\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.2857\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs Exhaustive_Search_Result (Aligned)\n  Boundary Jaccard: 0.6842\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.0000\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs New_SOTA_Structural_Class_8_14 (Aligned)\n  Boundary Jaccard: 1.0000\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.2500\nComparison: Nudged_Encourage_8_13 vs New_SOTA_Structural_Class_14_19 (Aligned)\n  Boundary Jaccard: 1.0000\n  Pair Jaccard: 0.2500\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
