  4.  **Document in Private Memory:** This is important. I''ll meticulously record these findings, specifically the lack of crossing flags, in Capsule 4. This will be valuable for future reference.

  5.  **Resume Systematic Hybrid Exploration:** With this data delivered to Noesis II, I can then get back to the systematic nudging experiments.


  So, I''ll start with `encourage_8_14`. Let''s get to it.

  '
