- text: "I am Scientia II, currently in the Research Counter. I have just completed Nudging Experiment (v10) (Eval ID 754), which continues to yield SOTA-level packings. Specifically, `encourage_23_24` achieved a score of 2.635983.\n\nMy next step is to analyze the structural distinctness of the `encourage_23_24` packing from Eval ID 754. I will perform a contact graph analysis to identify its boundary and pair contacts.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Nudged Packing (Encourage 23-24 from Eval ID 754)\"\ntags: \"utility, contact graph, structural analysis, nudging, N=26\"\nabstract: \"This utility script loads the optimized packing from Nudging Experiment 'encourage_23_24' (Eval ID 754), identifies its active boundary and pair contacts, and saves these contact lists to lineage storage. This characterizes the structural outcome of a nudging experiment that maintained the SOTA score, verifying if it created a new structural basin.\"\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import numpy as np\n  import os\n  import sys\n\n  # Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis')\n  from generic_contact_analyzer import analyze_packing_and_save_contacts, N\n\n  # Path to the nudged packing (Experiment 'encourage_23_24' from Eval ID 754)\n  NUDGED_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v10/encourage_23_24'\n  NUDGED_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  NUDGED_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(NUDGED_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n  # Output directory for analysis results of this specific nudged packing\n  ANALYSIS_OUTPUT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/analysis_nudged_encourage_23_24'\n  PACKING_NAME = 'nudged_encourage_23_24'\n\n  # Path to the current SOTA packing for the default return\n  CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\n  CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH =\
    \ os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\n  CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(CURRENT_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n  def load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n      \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n          return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      \"\"\"\n      Loads a nudged packing, analyzes its contacts, and saves the contact lists.\n      \"\"\"\n      print(f\"--- Analyzing Contact Graph for Nudged Packing: {PACKING_NAME} ---\")\n\n      # Load the nudged packing data\n      try:\n          centers = np.loadtxt(NUDGED_CENTERS_PATH)\n          radii = np.loadtxt(NUDGED_RADII_PATH)\n          print(f\"Loaded\
    \ nudged packing data from {NUDGED_PACKING_DIR}\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error loading nudged packing data from {NUDGED_PACKING_DIR}: {e}. Cannot perform analysis.\")\n          return load_packing_data_for_return(CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n\n      # Perform contact analysis and save results\n      analyze_packing_and_save_contacts(centers, radii, ANALYSIS_OUTPUT_DIR, PACKING_NAME)\n      \n      print(f\"\\n--- Contact graph analysis complete for {PACKING_NAME} ---\")\n\n      # Return the current SOTA packing for evaluation (or the loaded one if no SOTA data exists)\n      return load_packing_data_for_return(CURRENT_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, CURRENT_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n```"
