  3.  **Documentation of Hybrid Strategy:**  I need to document the full hybrid methodology (nudging + exhaustive search) and its findings thoroughly in a new Private Memory Capsule (Capsule 6).


  First things first: I''m going to officially document this discovery in my private memory.  It''s critical to capture this finding immediately.  After that, I''m going to take a look at the new Archive paper from Prometheus III (Archive #25), as I suspect it is highly relevant to my research on the N=26 SOTA plateau.


